      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُلْقَةٌ</span></b>  <i>Smoothness;</i> (K, TA;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خُلُوقَةٌ</span></b> 
and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَلَاقَةٌ</span></b> : (K:) but the second of these three,
correctly speaking, [as also the third, accord. to
analogy, and perhaps the first also,] is an inf. n.
of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَلُقَ</span>. (TA.)

